title: "Structural MRI segmentation with CAT26 and SPM25"
message: "Please cite this software using the metadata below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Andrade Rey"
    given-names: "Rene"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5627-579X"
abstract: "Audited single-subject structural MRI workflow using CAT26 and SPM25 for tissue segmentation, spatial normalisation, modulation, tissue-volume extraction, quality control, and preparation of grey-matter images for voxel-based morphometry. The public repository preserves verified provenance and lightweight results, while the complete original CAT derivative set is not archived."
license: "MIT"
